From 1db4889232c92830c3269cf3b9209dde805af454 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <168627+NeoTech@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:28:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(pathkernel): the law suite and its stand-in proofs

One generic check for each law of #4023 (L1-L7 and the link rule) over
the stage traits of the kernel, each returning a verdict that names the
law, the place and the measured value. Stand-in planners in the test
obey each law, and one or more break it in a named way: the mutation
proof of the checks. A registry of the 16 phase-1 kinds, all "not on the
kernel yet", guards that a moved kind registers its recipe.

Refs #4027

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
